  ],
  "description": "Line input, EQ bypassed, HPF off, normal phase and external K–L link fitted. EH10023 issue 3, EK20033 and BA283AV EX/10283. S2b selects the 0 and −10 dBm taps of the original seven-position line attenuator. The 31267 and LO1166 use linear winding models with estimated parasitics. TR1, TR2, TR4–TR6 use approximate BC184C transport cards and TR3 a 2N3055 transport card. The output-stage trim gives about 70 mA through the 47 Ω emitter resistor. Source 150 Ω, load 600 Ω. Mic input, powered EQ boards and magnetic saturation are outside this line path.",
  "io": {
    "groundNode": "0",
    "inputNode": "in",
    "outputNode": "out"
  },
